  "sourceTitle": "tokenizers v1: encode, decode and scaling, measured",
  "sourceBodyHash": "ca6fe5e5cd3acabbea51067c135df71f5eb1d39029e37f7328b6fcfb3002db0f",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T04:53:17.107428Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T10:25:55.243889Z",
  "totalBlocks": 98,
  "translatedBlocks": 97,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9363e9ecb7404eab",
      "translationZh": "在机器学习工作流中，分词器过去一直不是瓶颈。从计算量来看，与流水线其余部分繁重的建模计算相比，分词的开销很小。然而，在某些情况下，它已迅速成为加快（或拖慢）机器学习工作的关键。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b998013a3668b57e",
      "translationZh": "随着模型速度加快、工作负载规模扩大，这种平衡开始发生变化。在海量数据集上训练、同时处理大量并发请求，或反复处理长输入，都可能给分词器带来足够大的压力，导致模型得不到充足的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f0edb33050a4925",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们决定将即将发布的 tokenizers 版本 1 的重点放在性能上。分词应该开销很小，并且应该能随工作流的规模扩展。你的 GPU 绝不应该闲置着，等待 CPU 完成分词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb9a183c9e826009",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将探讨 v1 比 v0.23 更快的原因，其速度提升往往达到数十倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4afbcfcc2722a94",
      "translationZh": "这项工作之所以能够完成，完全得益于生态系统中的其他项目。分词是开源工作中非常活跃的一个领域，gigatoken、tiktoken、kitoken、tokie、fastokens、wordchipper 和 ai-tokenizer 等库，以及许多其他库，都各自推动了快速分词器能力边界的拓展。我们研读了这些工作，下文中的若干思路之所以进入我们的视野，是因为其他项目已经证明它们值得尝试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a766547ea0253ea9",
      "translationZh": "在这次重构之前，tokenizers 的性能远未达到其本可达到的水平，因此，为它贡献代码可能显得不太值得。通过这次重构，我们希望明确表明，我们有意让 tokenizers 成为一个值得贡献代码的库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03e383fec8aa3526",
      "translationZh": "我们也感谢 IBM、NVIDIA 和 ExecuTorch 团队贡献补丁，并帮助我们在各种硬件上开展测试，以扩大平台支持范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dac9cf15ac8cc941",
      "translationZh": "我们展示了 tokenizers v1 发布候选版本与其他广泛使用的替代方案的对比结果。我们将逐一介绍单线程、多线程、随线程数增加的扩展表现、按模型对比、按语言对比、延迟、解码吞吐量、堆内存，以及 crate 大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d48030979a7ba05",
      "translationZh": "我们在 tokbench 仓库中运行这些基准测试，并附上了一条命令，方便你在自己的硬件上重新运行这些基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8916b08ed3c7bc5f",
      "translationZh": "V1 是什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd822e1b91510330",
      "translationZh": "v1 将生成与 v0.23 相同的 token ID。我们的目标是保留输出、API、词表和合并优先级，并改进一切可以改进的方面。这也包括支持范围。该库继续通用地支持各类分词器，而不是专门针对 BPE，因此 v1 能加载 v0.23 能加载的所有内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "839fdec7d041775a",
      "translationZh": "分词器将文本转换为模型读取的整数列表。tokenizers 分四个阶段执行这一转换。规范化对原始文本执行转为小写或 Unicode 规范化等操作。预分词将文本拆分成称为预词元的更小片段。模型将每个预词元转换为词元，并将其映射到词表中的 ID。后处理添加模型所需的特殊词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3224c313c0f03e7c",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍的大部分工作都发生在模型阶段。本文测量的十个模型家族中，有八个使用字节对编码，即 BPE。BPE 从预词元的字节开始，反复合并优先级最高的相邻对，直到不再存在具有优先级排名的相邻对。这一排名在分词器训练时学得，并随分词器一同提供，因此相同的文本始终会生成相同的 ID。合并绝不会跨越预词元边界。其余两个家族使用 WordPiece 和 Unigram，这是该库支持的另外两种模型类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f73347ae40221d67",
      "translationZh": "分词流水线页面介绍了这四个阶段。分词算法页面介绍了 BPE、WordPiece 和 Unigram。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7ebba69ee636761",
      "translationZh": "每个阶段都进行了改进。以下是那些起到重要作用的改动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12ea12eace7d655f",
      "translationZh": "变更",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a4f5675191ddeb9",
      "translationZh": "作用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "323c645876c8e0ca",
      "translationZh": "工作空间拆分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b73373c8b7916de9",
      "translationZh": "一个 crate 变成了一个工作空间：tk-encode 是必需的运行时，而 tk-serialize、tk-convert 和 tk-train 仅在应用需要时才会被链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b218542b596d8023",
      "translationZh": "无分配模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9c44748af3f91e6",
      "translationZh": "合并操作的工作集存放在调用方拥有的临时缓冲区中；循环从不调用内存分配器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dc308f367cfe314",
      "translationZh": "分割模式转化为对比特流的布尔运算，使用 SIMD 指令寻找分割位置，而不是使用正则表达式引擎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b9464019305ea19",
      "translationZh": "合并循环重写",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d03cf6ffb6a233b",
      "translationZh": "待合并的片段在一个预分配的缓冲区内构成侵入式双向链表，因此一次合并只需更新两个索引，而不必移动数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f82111c02b065d7",
      "translationZh": "词缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ece4dbdec3626659",
      "translationZh": "一个线程局部的记忆化缓存，将预分词单元的字节映射到最终的 id，因此重复出现的词只需合并一次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d6828a282807dea",
      "translationZh": "原生并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5524cd76b91b3bb9",
      "translationZh": "多个线程同时使用同一个共享分词器进行编码；每个线程都从各自的子池中获取临时缓冲区和词缓存，因此线程不再排队争用同一把锁（#2365）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a019915295d04b0f",
      "translationZh": "切分：用位流取代正则表达式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d04a017c337c65e1",
      "translationZh": "BPE 模型使用正则表达式将输入文本切分成更小、更易于处理的块，称为预分词单元。合并发生在一个预分词单元内部，绝不会跨越两个预分词单元之间的边界，因此这种切分决定了流水线的其余部分会看到什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b9bbdd3dd21c958",
      "translationZh": "这个正则表达式是模型的一个固定参数。它随分词器一起提供，在运行时从不改变，因此没有必要在每次编码时都用通用正则表达式引擎来解释它。针对给定模型实际使用的模式，可以一次性手工编写一个等效的切分函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80abcd8e7a2d2596",
      "translationZh": "随后，手写函数就可以使用现代 CPU 的 SIMD 指令（单指令、多数据）。这些指令能同时对多个字节执行同一种操作，非常适合处理 UTF-8 文本。bitcannon 将输入字节视为并行的比特流，因此可以通过对整个寄存器执行布尔运算得出边界，而不是逐字符推进扫描。每次寄存器运算可判定 64 个字节。同样的思路也用于处理文本的 Parabix 和处理 JSON 的 simdjson。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a8c394064581f58",
      "translationZh": "这依赖于识别所用的模式。少数几种语法就能涵盖大多数字节级 BPE 模型；如果分词器使用的模式不在其中，它就会继续走正则表达式处理路径，无法获得上述任何加速。这就是上面的性能提升幅度差异如此之大的原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c798df6334bcee46",
      "translationZh": "词缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6578895e0a03f752",
      "translationZh": "真实文本包含大量重复的词。由于 BPE 对于给定的预分词单元总是生成相同的 token ID，v1 可以在处理一次后保存结果。线程局部缓存将每个预分词单元的字节映射到其 token ID，使之后再次出现的相同单元可以跳过合并过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fedf36bc7f443757",
      "translationZh": "自然地，随着输入增大，不同词的数量可能比词的总数增长得更慢。这样，重复词在输入中所占的比例就会越来越高。新的词仍会出现，这解释了下方动画中偶尔出现的缓存未命中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e01f98913fa59f16",
      "translationZh": "使用以下命令复现共享前缀的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98ee686f3898b5b3",
      "translationZh": "当输入包含重复的预分词单元时，缓存的效果最好。如果输入中重复的预分词单元很少，就可能承担了查找开销，却没有获得多少缓存命中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf15c414b43b17df",
      "translationZh": "合并循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a265f69bd5c0873",
      "translationZh": "下一个主要开销来自 BPE 合并循环。对于每个预分词单元，该循环会反复找出优先级最高的相邻对，并将其合并。之前的实现会在每次调用时分配新内存，并为每个预分词单元构建一个新的优先队列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62ed47c5bcfe8ec1",
      "translationZh": "v1 复用由调用方持有的临时缓冲区，消除了这些重复分配。它将符号存储在一个扁平数组中，并通过符号在该数组中的位置来链接相邻符号，从而降低合并过程中更新操作的开销。它还在一次模型调用中处理一批预分词单元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d33ebe7f4214208",
      "translationZh": "每个候选对也被打包成一个 64 位值，其中合并排序值存放在高位。这样，比较两个候选对就只需比较两个整数，而“此处不合并”对应的是可能的最大值，因此循环无需分支就能找到下一次要执行的合并。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "52a0f9b65b278850",
      "translationZh": "方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fb0796efe254dc4",
      "translationZh": "基准测试设计中的细微差异，可能导致分词器性能出现很大差异。我们采用了以下规则，以确保不同引擎之间的比较保持一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7369949b47ef2c6b",
      "translationZh": "规则",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2be23c585f15e5fd",
      "translationZh": "原因",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09d2f8dcea0bca58",
      "translationZh": "单一计时循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d303a697485959",
      "translationZh": "每个引擎都运行完全相同的循环；没有针对特定引擎的快速路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2428fe19395ea2e",
      "translationZh": "不计加载时间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "680ed42b315c1d9b",
      "translationZh": "词表加载单独计时，绝不计入 encode 内部",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f1bf31b0893ddf4",
      "translationZh": "已验证 id 哈希",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0ab8a8d719488c2",
      "translationZh": "对输出 id 计算的 FNV-1a 哈希必须与基准完全一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf9133de196a3a29",
      "translationZh": "仅使用共同测试单元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cc72a26811da766",
      "translationZh": "中位数基于每个引擎都运行过且通过验证的测试单元计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1701e6f4077da978",
      "translationZh": "每个进程执行一次完整扫描",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a35c8adbf8412ee7",
      "translationZh": "每次重复都在一个新进程中启动，并保留每个单元格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b233e255e2842842",
      "translationZh": "物理核心绑定",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab052c74611ebf4b",
      "translationZh": "工作进程绑定到八个不同的物理核心，绝不绑定到同一核心上的 SMT 兄弟线程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f91f5286076fede2",
      "translationZh": "独立的 Jobs",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e987cfebe3bfd94",
      "translationZh": "通过独立的 Jobs 测量主机之间的差异",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7163feb243319090",
      "translationZh": "在同一个构建版本上，反复编码同一份文档可能比编码一连串不同文档更快。第一种方法测量的是整份文档的表示已在缓存中时的性能。第二种方法测量的是处理新输入时的性能，同时允许之前见过的预分词片段保留在缓存中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d4503c461db8e51",
      "translationZh": "这两种条件有时都被称为“热”状态，尽管它们测量的是不同的工作负载。我们的主要结果使用不同的文档，而且完整语料库过大，无法全部放入缓存。分词器基准测试应明确说明使用的是哪种工作负载，因为这一选择可能主导测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac7bb27e16ef5dff",
      "translationZh": "这些改进带来的总体成果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e1ad5fed8b1d712",
      "translationZh": "对于 v1 编码路径所覆盖的十个模型家族，在 Apple M4 Max 上使用单线程时，其文本编码速度是 v0.23 的 3 到 30 倍。提升幅度最低的是 t5-base，最高的是 gpt2。在使用八个工作线程时，其扩展效率达到理想线性扩展的 76%。在所有这些改动中，v1 生成的 token ID 都与已发布的库完全一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4151b82dc1ff91e",
      "translationZh": "整体提升来自多项改动的协同作用：用手写的分割器替代正则表达式引擎；通过缓存返回重复词的结果，无需再次合并；合并循环完全不调用分配器；以及对每批预分词单元只调用一次模型，而不是对每个预分词单元调用一次。每项改动都减少了处理流水线中不同环节的工作量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2fc8cb18c01cd04",
      "translationZh": "下一项优先任务是支持更多模型家族。我们将在 1.0.0 之前让更多模型采用新的合并循环。候选发布版稳定后，下一步将是在 transformers 库以及生态系统中其他依赖 tokenizers 库的部分实现这些改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3017a67954958130",
      "translationZh": "本文根据 tokbench 结果生成，并将随着支持范围的扩大而更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "13707532633c354d",
      "translationZh": "如何获取",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38ac4fd2a9c36531",
      "translationZh": "v1 的候选发布版已在 crates.io 上提供。你调用的 API 还是原来使用的 API，因此唯一改变的是你安装哪个构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4dad7d087760c2e",
      "translationZh": "安装方式与平常一样：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b655ace2158ece4",
      "translationZh": "训练功能由一个默认启用的特性控制，该特性还会引入一个 C++ 依赖。如果你只需要编码，可以关闭它以排除训练实现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7a7b4c1e425f981",
      "translationZh": "编码保持不变：调用相同，得到的 ids 也相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f26919a4dff53b6",
      "translationZh": "本文中的每一项数据都是针对这个 crate 测得的。Python 绑定封装了相同的代码，并从 bindings/python 构建，但它们会增加每次调用的开销，而这些测量均未包含这部分开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff307ed67fada7a0",
      "translationZh": "迈向 V1 的进展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c77b43cb2f4e064",
      "translationZh": "本文中的基准测试涵盖了下文首先列出的、已完成的候选发布版工作。其余部分展示了 1.0.0 仍需完成的工作，以及我们计划在之后探索的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c2d77cc582376a72",
      "translationZh": "候选发布版：已实现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a4d667d7d8bf806",
      "translationZh": "这些工作已包含在 crates.io 上的 Rust 预发布版本中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53163378a6a57796",
      "translationZh": "workspace 拆分：将单个 crate 拆分为 tk-encode、tk-serialize、tk-convert 和 tk-train，使应用程序仅链接其使用的部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71646887e781cbf1",
      "translationZh": "bitcannon：用比特流操作替代编码路径上的正则表达式切分，覆盖 GPT-2、cl100k、o200k、Tekken 和 DeepSeek。这取代了最初发布的有限状态机 #2201 #2317",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad624b38c66d763d",
      "translationZh": "WordCache：复用此前处理过的预分词片段的 token ID #2262, af5a3e3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2103c574795bdda1",
      "translationZh": "更快的查找与合并结构：添加 FlatCache、MPHF RankStore、增量合并和 BucketVocabStore #2190 #2188",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ac53f4aa035235c",
      "translationZh": "可复用的模型内存：将模型的临时状态移入临时工作缓冲区，使分词不再在每次调用时分配内存 #2175 #2183",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12c7dd4381d638d0",
      "translationZh": "流水线后处理：将后处理作为 STAGE_POST 流水线阶段开放 #2182",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81c592e17810a245",
      "translationZh": "批量模型调用：在一次调用中处理多个预分词片段区间 #2304",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70707778951cdcbb",
      "translationZh": "更快的解码：将解码后的字节直接写入可复用缓冲区，避免中间字符串和复制，加速 token 查找，支持带缓冲的流式处理，并并行解码批次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5aec2a3bd0b4bbf5",
      "translationZh": "支持 role_to_token #2343",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "396cf0eaf70a43e5",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 绑定 #2281",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8814f1bdb5d9c1ed",
      "translationZh": "统一的编码实现：在训练验证期间使用 tk-encode，确保训练和推理不会产生不同的分词结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97217eb2ec89e93d",
